sentences.text:
This writ petition is filed seeking for following reliefs:
(a) Issue writ of certiorari quashing the general award dated 12.07.2017 bearing No.LAQ:2017/2018 at Annexure-'G' passed by the respondent no.3 under Section 11 of the Land Acquisition Act 1894 in respect of petitioners property is concerned.;
(b) Issue any suitable order, direction or writ in the nature of mandamus directing the respondent herein to consider the case of the petitioner as per Section 29(2) of the KIAD Act, etc.
